  "readmeFile": "blender-render-host.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Preview 2 of the FeatherCompute C# GPU frontend for EasyGPU. Fixes five shader-DSL gaps: generic [Callable] methods now compile (type-parameter local variables, unmanaged-constrained type parameters, and generic callables declared inside the kernel type are discovered instead of being silently dropped); ref/out/in parameters are accepted on [Callable] methods; [InlineArray] struct fields map to fixed-size GPU arrays with correct layout; zero-argument constructors and default(T) lower to zero values on both the managed and native typed-IR paths. Also updates the SetTextureOutput sizing test to match the relaxed intermediate-socket contract.",
